  "items": [
    {
      "name": "Why This Gets Missed",
      "char_file": "소고기_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Heavier periods and pelvic",
        "pressure often get filed under",
        "\"my cycle is just rough\"",
        "",
        "Up to 80% of women have fibroids",
        "by age 50, and most never",
        "notice them at all"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Red Meat and Risk",
      "char_file": "소고기_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "The Office on Women's Health",
        "links a lot of red meat and ham",
        "with higher fibroid risk",
        "",
        "In one case-control study the top",
        "third for beef had 1.7 times",
        "the odds of the lowest third"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Rebalance the Plate",
      "char_file": "소고기_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Move two red-meat dinners a week",
        "to fish, beans or lentils",
        "",
        "The same data put the highest",
        "green-vegetable intake at",
        "roughly half the odds"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Where Beer Shows Up",
      "char_file": "맥주_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "In a cohort of 21,885 women,",
        "seven or more beers a week",
        "came with a 57% higher rate",
        "",
        "Smoking and caffeine showed",
        "no overall link in the",
        "same group of women"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Set a Weekly Ceiling",
      "char_file": "맥주_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Keep beer well under",
        "seven drinks a week",
        "",
        "At one to six a week the",
        "difference was not reliable,",
        "so the ceiling is the useful part"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "The Vitamin D Gap",
      "char_file": "태양_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "NICHD lists vitamin D deficiency",
        "as a fibroid risk factor",
        "",
        "Women above 20 ng/mL had 32%",
        "lower odds than women",
        "below that line"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Test Before You Supplement",
      "char_file": "태양_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Ask for a blood level first",
        "",
        "The adult RDA is 600 IU a day",
        "and the upper limit is 4,000 IU,",
        "so high doses need a clinician"
      ]
    }
  ],
